p08 : US Blanks 10'10"T (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 238.1 L)
p97 : I tried to make this Stand Up blank as versatile as possible. It has plenty of width and thickness to do just about anything in a Stand Up Paddle surfboard. The rocker should also allow shapers a wide range of options.
